## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Backend — Bổ sung API endpoint bulk-sync

Endpoint hiện có `POST /api/v1/attendance/check-in` đã hỗ trợ `room_id + timestamp → session` mapping. Cần thêm **1 endpoint bulk** để sync nhiều bản ghi cùng lúc (tối ưu cho manual sync).

#### [NEW] Bulk sync endpoint

Thêm vào [attendance.py](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Desktop/MIS/hrm-flutter_dev_2.0/hrm-flutter_dev_2.0/face_time_keeping/backend/app/routers/v1/attendance.py):

```python
POST /api/v1/attendance/bulk-check-in
Request:  { "items": [ManualCheckinRequest, ...] }
Response: { "results": [ { "local_id": "...", "success": true, "attendance_id": "..." }, ... ] }
```

#### [NEW] Schema cho bulk request

Thêm vào [attendance_checkin.py](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Desktop/MIS/hrm-flutter_dev_2.0/hrm-flutter_dev_2.0/face_time_keeping/backend/app/schemas/v1/attendance_checkin.py):

