## Luồng dữ liệu sau Refactor

### Manual Sync Flow
```
User bấm "Đồng bộ" trên AttendanceReport
  │
  ▼
AttendanceReportCubit.syncToBackend()
  │
  ├─ LocalService.getPendingEduCheckIns()     ← lấy queue offline
  │
  ▼
EduSyncService.syncPendingCheckIns(items)
  │ POST /api/v1/attendance/bulk-check-in
  │ Backend mapping: roomId + timestamp → session
  │
  ▼
Nhận BulkCheckinResponse
  │
  ├─ LocalService.markEduCheckInSynced()      ← đánh dấu local
  ├─ shareEvent(EduSyncCompleteEvent())       ← trigger reload
  │
  ▼
AttendanceHistoryBloc listens EduSyncCompleteEvent
  │ → loadHistory()
  │ → GET /api/v1/attendance/history
  │
  ▼
UI AttendanceHistoryPage tự refresh
```

